<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Order Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-top: none;
        }
        .order-details {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .order-id {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #4CAF50;
        }
        .total {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .items-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .items-table th, .items-table td {
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        .items-table th {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Order Confirmed!</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>Thank you for your order! We're processing it now and will notify you when it ships.</p>

        <div class="order-details">
            <p class="order-id">Order #{{order_id}}</p>
            <p class="total">Total: {{formatCurrency total currency}}</p>
        </div>

        {{#if items}}
        <h3>Order Items</h3>
        <table class="items-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Item</th>
                    <th>Qty</th>
                    <th>Price</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {{#each items}}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{name}}</td>
                    <td>{{quantity}}</td>
                    <td>{{formatCurrency price ../currency}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/each}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/if}}

        <p>If you have any questions about your order, please contact our support team.</p>

        <center>
            <a href="#" class="button">Track Your Order</a>
        </center>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>This email was sent regarding your recent order.</p>
        <p>&copy; 2024 Your Company. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
